' A city's name in its controller's colour (`DrawWorldLocationText`,
' Maps/MapViewOverlayHoverText.cs:162-172; `Location.ControllingPlayer`,
' Logic/Location.cs:93-110). Run on a prepared save: a v1.2 game's save
' (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30`, `save` at once) with its `camp`
' lines edited so that one player holds Stove Vent (10), its neighbour 9 and
' 15, every road out of the city at 395,292 (location 8). `savefile` names
' it. With all three held by seat 0 the city's name is the player's green;
' split between two seats, or a city nobody controls, light grey.
load
wait 10
mapmove 395,292          ' the city
wait 2
snap city
mapmove 354,317          ' Stove Vent, no city: grey whoever holds it
wait 2
snap place
quit
